Samuel Ostmann is a very formal, slightly pudgy vampire. He has a black cape with a red lining, but otherwise is in full evening dress; a somewhat old-fashioned tuxedo. The vampire effect is achieved by a realistic set of fangs which he rubs occasionally, as though they itched.
The Astronaut is now near the fireplace.

