Ballroom, Near Kitchen
The northern end of the ballroom, next to the door leading to the kitchen. To the west is a band platform.
Elsewhere in this large ballroom, there are scores of other party guests dressed in all sorts of outlandish costumes. On the dance floor are many of the younger dancers. A record player is playing "Karma Chameleon" (the band is on its break).
On the periphery of the room small groups can be seen, discussing everything from politics to local scandals. Ostmann is near the French door leading to the patio. Michael is near the south entrance. Colonel Marston is near the fireplace. The Astronaut and Alicia and the Werewolf and Linda and Johnson are at the bar.
