Ballroom, Near Kitchen
The northern end of the ballroom, next to the door leading to the kitchen. To the west is a band platform.
Elsewhere in this large ballroom, there are scores of other party guests dressed in all sorts of outlandish costumes. On the dance floor are many of the younger dancers. A record player is playing "Pretty Woman" (the band is on its break).
On the periphery of the room small groups can be seen, discussing everything from politics to local scandals. Alicia is on the dance floor. The Astronaut and Colonel Marston and Michael are near the fireplace. Ostmann and the Werewolf and Linda and Johnson are at the bar.
