Kitchen
This is a large country kitchen. It is quite disarrayed right now because of the party. There are doorways leading south to the ballroom, west to the dining room, and north to the back entry. There is a stove with a kettle boiling on top of it, and telephone over a counter on one wall.
In the corner is a trash basket.
The trash basket contains:
  a broken glass
The band members are on their break. They are sitting around joking, drinking coffee, and wolfing down sandwiches and shrimp cocktail.

